Epoch 2's fixes worked: the script follows the shape ("An air conditioner, in five parts.", "Making cold air? Nope.", "One:" to "Four:"); the yard set looks like the reference (grass, picket fence, pines, hills, pixel clouds, violet-to-pink sky) and the studio is a cool blue against it (harmony now "complementary with extra hues", like the reference); a tall outdoor unit with a fan grille; every step and the payoff open the casing and label the part the line names (refrigerant, evaporator, compressor, expansion valve, condenser), headers 1/4 to 3/4 correct; a "part" close-up on the compressor; the fox host faces the camera.
